Package: rsrb-rs812-hw
Version: 2.1.0
Architecture: armel
Maintainer: Syntax-XXX <Syntax-XXX@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: smartmontools, hdparm, ethtool
Replaces: rsrb-rs812 (<< 2.0.0)
Breaks: rsrb-rs812 (<< 2.0.0)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Syntax-XXX/rs812-debian
Description: Synology RS812 hardware support for RSRB
 Fan control by disk temperature (rs812-fan.service; sleeping disks are not
 woken), the hardware modules (gpio-fan, RTC) and network/disk tuning measured
 on the RS812 (shorter RX interrupt coalescing, 4 MiB read-ahead on data arrays).
